## Checklist (same turn as code)

- [ ] `docs/changelog/*-[draft].md` updated (add / edit / remove bullets)
- [ ] Bullets user-facing and match current code
- [ ] Before the release workflow: bullets pruned to what actually ships (the freeze snapshots the draft into the tag)
- [ ] Freeze to `done/X.Y.Z-[released].md`, README update, and fresh `X.Y.x-[draft].md` are done **automatically** by the release workflow (`changelog_freeze.sh`) — only backfill by hand if a tag was cut without it
